  "lead": "<img class=\"source-question\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Enlarge question\" alt=\"Question 3 Find the minimum value of |x−1|+|x−2|+|x−3|+|x−4| over all real x. A 2 B 3 C 4 D 5 E 6 F 8 G 10 m o c . s h t a m z j\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">",
